<title>FRANCE: Havas Media Communication 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Havas Media Communication 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   280.0  vs	   266.4</p>
<p>    Operating				    472.0  vs	   416.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 510.0  vs	   459.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				  10,255.0  vs	 9,721.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Havas Media Communication, a unit of Havas, gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
